    "form4_coverage_days": 365,
    "cut": "BOTTOM tercile of sell_intensity among buyback names is HELD; the TOP tercile is the reported agency-conflict cell and is never shorted",
    "tie_break": "sell_intensity ascending, then buyback_intensity desc",
    "cadence": "QUARTERLY. The monthly CRSP panel is pre-aggregated into quarterly `ym` buckets and `run_monthly` is run over those UNMODIFIED \u2014 the spec's own preferred option, chosen over a `rebalance_months` gate that would change the engine five other books were read under",
