    {
      "falsifier": "survives_outside_the_smallest_names",
      "registered_as": "TRIAL-DRAFT-I section 5 clause 3: re-run inside the TOP HALF of the covered eligible band by dollar volume, twin RE-DRAWN there, and require the net excess to stay positive. The cited composite is equal-weighted, which is the weighting that hides a small-cap payoff.",
